Package: devjam-archive-keyring
Version: 1.43-1
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Signing keys for the dev-jam apt repositories
 OpenPGP keys that sign the dev-jam apt repository
 (https://dev-jam.github.io/debian/, dev-jam.asc) and the dev-jam
 external repository (https://dev-jam.github.io/debian-external/,
 dev-jam-external.asc), installed in /usr/share/keyrings for use with
 Signed-By in deb822 .sources files.
